or also known as the Bay four slash Bay five

00:04:37.589 --> 00:04:38.589
wave.

00:04:38.589 --> 00:04:41.479
Remember we had the original micron wave and
then the secondary.

00:04:41.479 --> 00:04:45.379
Okay, so now we're on Bay four and Bay five
variants.

00:04:45.379 --> 00:04:52.529
If you look at South Africa, you see that
this Wave five has already leveled off and

00:04:52.529 --> 00:04:54.580
started to decline.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:58.370
And so oftentimes what happens in South Africa
happens.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:04.699
In the United States somewhere around six,
eight, ten weeks, 6 to 8 weeks later.

00:05:04.699 --> 00:05:07.949
And we hope that that's the case and that
this is the peak.

00:05:07.949 --> 00:05:11.189
But this is these are incredible numbers.

00:05:11.189 --> 00:05:13.939
Half a million infections believed per day.

00:05:13.939 --> 00:05:19.110
And one other element of this that's a bit
concerning is we may already be kind of behind

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:24.810
on vaccines, the American tailored vaccine,
which is going to be tailored to the first

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:31.219
American variant back from late November,
early December 2021.

00:05:31.219 --> 00:05:36.809
That vaccine is going to be out in a couple
of months, and by then we're going to be like

00:05:36.809 --> 00:05:38.300
five variants away.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.659
So so from that.

00:05:39.659 --> 00:05:45.860
So there's a real question as to whether we
can even keep up or catch up when it comes

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:51.729
to vaccination, because it takes a while to
get the vaccines updated.

00:05:51.729 --> 00:05:52.969
So that's what's going on.

